    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 5.99,
    "end": 5.99,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 6.0,
    "end": 8.64,
    "text": " \"Please don't give me that money.\" The",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 7.31,
    "end": 8.64,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 7.32,
    "end": 10.44,
    "text": "man stopped  and looked at the",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 8.63,
    "end": 10.44,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 8.64,
    "end": 12.445,
    "text": "stranger sitting outside the restaurant.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 10.43,
    "end": 12.445,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 10.44,
    "end": 14.52,
    "text": "The stranger was an old man with dirty",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 12.435,
    "end": 14.52,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 12.445,
    "end": 16.16,
    "text": " clothes, tired eyes, and an",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 14.51,
    "end": 16.16,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 14.52,
    "end": 17.8,
    "text": "empty cup beside him. \"I'm not giving it",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 16.15,
    "end": 17.8,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 16.16,
    "end": 19.65,
    "text": "to you. Come with me. I'll buy you",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 17.79,
    "end": 19.65,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 17.8,
    "end": 20.0,
    "text": "something to eat.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 19.64,
    "end": 20.0,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 19.65,
    "end": 22.92,
    "text": " ",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 19.99,
    "end": 22.92,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 20.0,
    "end": 24.6,
    "text": " \"You would do that for me?\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 22.91,
    "end": 24.6,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 22.92,
    "end": 26.56,
    "text": " \"Of course.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 24.59,
    "end": 26.56,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 24.6,
    "end": 28.28,
    "text": "The man invited him inside and offered",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 26.55,
    "end": 28.28,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 26.56,
    "end": 30.0,
    "text": "to buy him something to eat. The old man",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 28.27,
    "end": 30.0,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 28.28,
    "end": 32.04,
    "text": "looked surprised. They walked into the",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 29.99,
    "end": 32.04,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 30.0,
    "end": 34.48,
    "text": "restaurant, but as soon as they entered,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 32.03,
    "end": 34.48,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 32.04,
    "end": 37.28,
    "text": "the manager rushed toward them.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 34.47,
    "end": 37.28,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 34.48,
    "end": 38.12,
    "text": " \"Sir, you can't bring him in here.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 37.27,
    "end": 38.12,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 37.28,
    "end": 39.64,
    "text": " \"Why not?\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 38.11,
    "end": 39.64,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 38.12,
    "end": 41.28,
    "text": " \"He comes here every day asking",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 39.63,
    "end": 41.28,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 39.64,
    "end": 42.12,
    "text": "customers for money. He causes ",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 41.27,
    "end": 42.12,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 41.28,
    "end": 43.0,
    "text": "problems.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 42.11,
    "end": 43.0,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 42.12,
    "end": 45.28,
    "text": " \"He's eating with me.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 42.99,
    "end": 45.28,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 43.0,
    "end": 47.0,
    "text": " The manager became quiet. They sat down.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 45.27,
    "end": 47.0,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 45.28,
    "end": 48.28,
    "text": "The man ordered a hot meal for the old",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 46.99,
    "end": 48.28,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 47.0,
    "end": 49.92,
    "text": "man. As they waited",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 48.27,
    "end": 49.92,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 48.28,
    "end": 51.36,
    "text": " \"Why are you helping me?\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 49.91,
    "end": 51.36,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 49.92,
    "end": 52.28,
    "text": " \"Because one day I might be the person",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 51.35,
    "end": 52.28,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 51.36,
    "end": 53.76,
    "text": "who needs help.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 52.27,
    "end": 53.76,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 52.28,
    "end": 55.64,
    "text": " The old man stared at him for a few",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 53.75,
    "end": 55.64,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 53.76,
    "end": 56.64,
    "text": "seconds. \"You have no idea what you just",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 55.63,
    "end": 56.64,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 55.64,
    "end": 58.2,
    "text": "did.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 56.63,
    "end": 58.2,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 56.64,
    "end": 59.52,
    "text": "After they  finished eating",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 58.19,
    "end": 59.52,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 58.2,
    "end": 61.48,
    "text": " \"Thank you very much for the meal.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 59.51,
    "end": 61.48,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 59.52,
    "end": 62.8,
    "text": " The man nodded and walked away. He",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 61.47,
    "end": 62.8,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 61.48,
    "end": 65.08,
    "text": "thought  that was the end of it,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 62.79,
    "end": 65.08,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 62.8,
    "end": 66.81,
    "text": "but 3 days later, while he was at work,",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 65.07,
    "end": 66.81,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 65.08,
    "end": 68.83,
    "text": "his boss called him into the office.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 66.8,
    "end": 68.83,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 66.81,
    "end": 68.83,
    "text": " ",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 69.79,
    "end": 69.79,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 69.8,
    "end": 72.705,
    "text": " \"We need to talk.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 70.91,
    "end": 72.705,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 70.92,
    "end": 72.72,
    "text": " The man became nervous.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 72.695,
    "end": 72.72,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 72.705,
    "end": 74.72,
    "text": " ",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 72.71,
    "end": 74.72,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 72.72,
    "end": 77.24,
    "text": " \"What is this?\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 74.71,
    "end": 77.24,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 74.72,
    "end": 78.36,
    "text": " \"Your company has been sold.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 77.23,
    "end": 78.36,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 77.24,
    "end": 81.04,
    "text": " \"Sold?\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 78.35,
    "end": 81.04,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 78.36,
    "end": 82.6,
    "text": " \"And the new owner wants to meet you.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 81.03,
    "end": 82.6,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 81.04,
    "end": 84.4,
    "text": " The door opened. The man looked ",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 82.59,
    "end": 84.4,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 82.6,
    "end": 86.08,
    "text": "up and his mouth dropped open. It was",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 84.39,
    "end": 86.08,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 84.4,
    "end": 87.92,
    "text": "the old man from the restaurant, but he",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 86.07,
    "end": 87.92,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 86.08,
    "end": 89.68,
    "text": "wasn't wearing dirty clothes anymore. He",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 87.91,
    "end": 89.68,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 87.92,
    "end": 91.4,
    "text": "was wearing an expensive suit.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 89.67,
    "end": 91.4,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 89.68,
    "end": 92.48,
    "text": " homeless. I was testing how someone who",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 91.39,
    "end": 92.48,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 91.4,
    "end": 94.08,
    "text": "looked like he had nothing",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 92.47,
    "end": 94.08,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 92.48,
    "end": 96.941,
    "text": " He handed the man the envelope.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 94.07,
    "end": 96.941,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 94.08,
    "end": 98.04,
    "text": " \"Inside is a promotion and a big raise.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 96.931,
    "end": 98.04,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 96.941,
    "end": 100.44,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 98.03,
    "end": 100.44,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 98.04,
    "end": 101.76,
    "text": " \"I didn't help you to get a reward.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 100.43,
    "end": 101.76,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 100.44,
    "end": 103.52,
    "text": " The old man smiled.",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 101.75,
    "end": 103.52,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 101.76,
    "end": 104.04,
    "text": " \"I know. That's exactly why you deserve",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 103.51,
    "end": 104.04,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 103.52,
    "end": 106.12,
    "text": "it.\"",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 104.03,
    "end": 106.12,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 104.04,
    "end": 108.12,
    "text": " Moral: Never judge people by how they",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 106.11,
    "end": 108.12,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 106.12,
    "end": 111.72,
    "text": "look, and never stop being kind ",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 108.11,
    "end": 111.72,
    "text": "",
    "textdich": ""
  },
  {
    "start": 108.12,
    "end": 111.72,
    "text": "just because nobody is watching.",
    "textdich": ""
  }
]